<import src="../../templates/status.wxml"/><view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">FITCREW · PROFILE</view><view class="title">我的身体，我做主</view><view class="subtitle">你的记录只属于你。</view><template is="status" data="{{loading,error,busy}}"/><view class="card"><view class="h2">{{signedIn ? '私有账户已连接' : '连接我的账户'}}</view><view class="body">以微信身份登录后保存旅程、实验与身体记录。免费使用，无支付与微信提醒。</view><button bindtap="openPrivacy">阅读隐私保护指引</button><button wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="primary" bindtap="login" disabled="{{busy}}">阅读说明并微信登录</button></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">Apple 健康</view><view class="body">小程序不能直接读取 HealthKit。请通过 FitCrew iOS 客户端授权并同步；只有绑定到同一账户的数据才会在这里显示。</view><block wx:if="{{state}}"><view class="field">已同步 {{state.health.sample_count}} 条</view><view class="small muted">最后同步：{{state.health.last_sync_at || '尚无同步'}}</view></block></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">AI 实验选择</view><block wx:if="{{caps}}"><view class="body">{{caps.ai_notice}}</view><view class="small muted">服务商：{{caps.ai_provider || '尚未配置'}} · 披露版本：{{caps.ai_notice_version || '尚未配置'}}</view><view wx:if="{{!caps.ai_available}}" class="muted">AI 服务当前不可用。规则建议会明确标记为「规则建议」。</view><button bindtap="ai" disabled="{{busy || (!caps.ai_available &amp;&amp; !caps.ai_consent_granted)}}">{{caps.ai_consent_granted ? '撤回 AI 使用同意' : '阅读并单独同意 AI 使用'}}</button></block><view wx:else class="muted">登录并读取服务能力后显示服务商与授权状态。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">数据与隐私</view><button bindtap="exportData" disabled="{{busy || !signedIn}}">导出我的数据</button><block wx:if="{{exportPath}}"><view class="small body">已写入本机私有沙箱：{{exportPath}}</view><button bindtap="shareExport">选择导出文件的接收位置</button></block><button bindtap="clearExport">清除本机导出（含上次保存）</button><button class="danger" bindtap="erase" data-kind="data" disabled="{{busy || !signedIn}}">删除全部私有数据</button><button class="danger" bindtap="erase" data-kind="account" disabled="{{busy || !signedIn}}">注销账户</button><view wx:if="{{receipt}}" class="small body">服务端删除回执：{{receipt}}</view></view><view class="footer">FitCrew 提供生活方式记录与观察。实验结果不证明因果，不用于医疗诊断、治疗或用药。隐私说明版本 2026-09-07。</view></view>
